<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] - Exercicio14ASP</title>
    <script type="importmap"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/Exercicio14ASP.styles.css" asp-append-version="true" />
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-sm navbar-toggleable-sm navbar-light bg-white border-bottom box-shadow mb-3">
            <div class="container-fluid">
                <a class="navbar-brand" asp-area="" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">Exercicio14ASP</a>
                <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target=".navbar-collapse" aria-controls="navbarSupportedContent"
                        aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation">
                    <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
                </button>
                <div class="navbar-collapse collapse d-sm-inline-flex justify-content-between">
                    <ul class="navbar-nav flex-grow-1">
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link text-dark" asp-area="" asp-controller="Admin" asp-action="Admin"> Admin </a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link text-dark" asp-area="" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">Home</a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto">
                        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link text-primary fw-bold" asp-controller="Admin" asp-action="Logout"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock"></i> Logout</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>
    <div class="container">
        <main role="main" class="pb-3">
            @RenderBody()
        </main>
    </div>

    <footer class="footer footer-custom py-1">
        <div class="container d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">

            <div style="max-width: 80%; line-height: 1.1;">
                <span style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: bold; display: block;">
                    &copy; 2026 CENCAL - miniCMS
                </span>
                <span style="font-size: 0.5rem; display: block; text-align: justify;">
                    Todos os direitos reservados. O conteúdo deste portal, incluindo o motor de gestão de conteúdos e bases de dados associadas, é protegido por lei. <br />
                    A utilização não autorizada pode resultar em sanções civis e criminais. Processado em conformidade com as normas de segurança digital e proteção de dados em vigor.
                </span>
            </div>

            <div class="calendar-card" style="transform: scale(0.8); margin: 0;">
                <div class="month">@DateTime.Now.ToString("MMM").Replace(".", "").ToUpper()</div>
                <div class="day">@DateTime.Now.Day</div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </footer>
    <script src="~/lib/jquery/dist/jquery.min.js"></script>
    <script src="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="~/js/site.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
    @await RenderSectionAsync("Scripts", required: false)
</body>
</html>
